<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Acolyte Heal Spam</Major>
    <Description>1. Set the Heal skill to key "F", Graphic Resolution Setting 1600 x 900. 

2. Make sure your Ragnarok game window is set to the top, most left of your screen, in order for this macro to work properly.

3. Next, create a party, Press Alt + Z, to open the party member list window.

4. Leave the party window under your fully expanded short keys window. (1, 2, 3, 4: Total 4 lanes of skills) You are now all ready to spam heal to yourself. 

5. Remember to set this macro to whichever key you wish to use with Keyran, set the Operating mode to "Run until pressed again". Walaa~ You are now ready to spam non stop Heal. :D

______________________________________________________________________________

I will create another version, Spam heal for the party of 2. Stay tuned!

Thank you Keyran for making gaming experience so much easier, pleasant and stress free! :)</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
